; BTCTrader_EA - GoldTrader BTCUSD preset
; Chart: your BTCUSD chart (any timeframe) > EA Inputs > Load. Entries come from
; start_btc.bat (app/main.py --profile btc); this EA only manages them:
; the stop is locked at +1R profit, then trailed 0.5R behind price, where R is
; each trade's own opening stop (about one M15 ATR, 0.20%-2.0% of price).
; InpMagicNumber / InpLockR / InpTrailR MUST match app/profiles.py 'btc'.
; InpDryRun=true logs only - set false to manage real positions.
; InpExportCalendar=true only if UnifiedTrader_EA (gold) is NOT running.
;
InpMagicNumber=20260931
InpLockR=1.0
InpTrailR=0.5
InpDryRun=true
InpExportCalendar=false
InpCalendarExportFile=econ_calendar.csv
InpNewsCurrencies=USD
InpCalendarRefreshMin=30
